erved_at":"2026-10-26T13:34:57Z","value":24242,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4349200","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1847286114044034","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"announcement","title":"Global Release Times and Pricing","summary":"Probably Stolen Global Release Times & Pricing Probably Stolen is launching in just 2 days! With opening day just around the corner, here's everything you need to know about when you can play the full game and how much it'll cost. When Can You Play? We're launching on October 28 at 2:00 PM CET / 9:00 AM EDT / 6:00 AM PDT! Regional Pricing Here's a look at the expected pricing for Probably Stolen across different regions. [*] US: $19.99 [/*][*] EU: €19.99 [/*][*] UK: £16.99 [/*][*] CN: ¥55 [/*][*","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:06:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044034","verified_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1847286114030254","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"announcement","title":"Opening October 28: What's in Store for 1.0 Release?","summary":"Just a week away from launch day!With Probably Stolen launching on October 28th, we wanted to give you an overview of all the features and content you can expect in the full 1.0 release. Do keep in mind, however, that the release of 1.0 does not mean the end of development. We plan to continue developing the game with regular free content updates after release.Here's what will be new in 1.0:Game EndingWhere you can purchase and own the store. End game itemsExpanded Difficulty OptionsAfter pickin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:38:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030254","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:47:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1846651706689954","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Aquafarmer 🐟","summary":"Hello Shopkeepers,We are just 10 days away from Probably Stolen's launch on October 28th! And today, we're bringing you another content update for the current playable Demo, with a new Wild’s Network Upgrade.🐟 Retired AquafarmerA new retired merchant will sell the the equipement allowing you to raise fish in tanks to harvest and sell their meat. You begin with a basic water circulation system, a stock of tilapia, and a supply of fish food. Aquaculture is slower-paced, requires less maintenance a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:15:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1843481262702145","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"update","title":"UPDATE 049 Patch note - Release Date + New Demo","summary":"Probably Stolen has an official release date. It is launching on October 28th!And we've also just released a new Demo build, with a ton of changes since the open playtest. Check out the full patch notes below.ContentNew Machine - Added 1 new early game machine and 1 corresponding new itemStarting Perks - Added 2 Starting Perks, designed for challenge runsEquip mode - for selectable items, allowing tools to be quickly used on multiple items (Credit to @AdrianNumbers for the original idea)Toolbox ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T15:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1843481262690182","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Ledger: Numbers, Lessons and What's Next","summary":"Hey Shopkeepers, It’s been a month since we announced Probably Stolen and opened the Playtest, and thanks to all of your reports, feedback, surveys filled and watching you play the game on Discord, we’d like to share what we’ve captured from your thoughts so far and the playtest statistics!Counting the Contraband: The Playtest Numbers: What you've told us:We’ve found that you've been loving the depth Probably Stolen has to offer and want more of pretty much everything: more unique customers, mor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T19:03:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1842212951304317","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 Wishlists and unique players + our nearest plans","summary":"Hey, shopkeepers! Thanks so all of you, Probably Stolen has reached 100,000 wishlists!And also 100,000 players have tried our Steam playtest.Developer Bei Ning and the art team have been hard at work behind the counter and we’re excited to announce that a Probably Stolen Demo is coming on September 14th! That’s right, demo, not playtest! It will feature a new starting scenario: The Water Merchant, along with tons of improvements we’ve made using everything we learned from your feedback. Some of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T20:36:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1840310314345942","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 48.3.12 - The Rat Wrangler","summary":"Hey Shopkeepers,Another update just released, where we have unhidden the Rat Wrangler starting scenario!ChangesThe Rat Wrangler starting scenario (previously secret) is now visible alongside the other starting scenariosA cleared inspection that resulted from showing contraband in the display case will no longer grant Security reputation. This prevents players from farming free Security reputation by repeatedly displaying contraband and then hiding it in the smuggler bay to pass inspectionBug Fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T18:54:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345942","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1840310314342898","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 48.3.10 - Rock Bottom & Water Upgrade","summary":"Hey Shopkeepers,We've rolled out an update to the open Playtest build, including a new hard mode starting scenario, water upgrades and lots of quality of life and bug fixes!New Content New starting scenario: Rock Bottom (hardcore mode, you start with nothing) Water trading guide can now be bought from Dr. Jackson New Wild Network upgrades available in the open playtest: Retired Water Merchant, Gutterflow on Tap, Rustwater on Tap (Not the Water Trade Starting Scenario when starting a new game) Qu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T19:01:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4348910-1839676055895202","game_id":"steam-4348910","kind":"announcement","title":"Probably Stolen: Cyberpunk Pawnshop Simulator","summary":"Welcome shopkeepers,We’re thrilled to announce our new game called Probably Stolen, with a playtest available right now! What is the game?Probably Stolen is a cyberpunk pawnshop simulator set in a dystopian space station where you gotta trade, craft, flip goods, maybe smuggle a little on the side, and try not to piss off the wrong people. It’s up to you to decide how far you’re willing to go to stay afloat and earn enough cash to own the shop before rent gets out of hand. About the developer:Dev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T16:13:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4348910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4348910":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4348910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z"},"4349200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:22Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4348910","app_id":4348910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"89c2c00c1ba353d8114e8af14caeb666ea03d95d08189d1adfc67b653b38a9fb","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Pro